               describe the functionality and implementation of the new package,
               and give some examples of its use. I briefly describe functions
               for fitting the FvCB model of photosynthesis to measurements of
               photosynthesis-CO2 response curves ('A-Ci curves'), fitting
               Ball-Berry type models, modelling C3 photosynthesis with the
               coupled photosynthesis-stomatal conductance model, modelling C4
               photosynthesis, numerical solution of optimal stomatal behaviour,
               and energy balance calculations using the Penman-Monteith
               equation. This open-source package makes technically challenging
               calculations easily accessible for many users and is freely
