  journal   = "Methods Ecol. Evol.",
  publisher = "Wiley",
  abstract  = "Abstract Species interactions play a crucial role in shaping
               biodiversity, species coexistence, population dynamics, community
               stability and ecosystem functioning. Our understanding of the
               role of the diversity of species interactions driving these
               species, community and ecosystem features is limited because
