               developed a modular, user‐friendly, and extensible Julia package
               that delivers the core functionality of the bio‐energetic food
               web model. Moreover, it embeds several ecological interaction
               types alongside the capacity to manipulate external drivers of
               ecological dynamics. These new features represent important
               processes known to influence biodiversity, coexistence,
               functioning and stability in natural communities. Specifically,
               they include: (a) an explicit multiple nutrient intake model for
