  number    =  1,
  pages     = "219--272",
  abstract  = "Abstract Conventional approaches to natural resource management
               are increasingly challenged by environmental problems that are
               embedded in highly complex systems with profound uncertainties.
               These so‐called social‐ecological systems (SESs) are
               characterized by strong links between the social and the
               ecological system and multiple interactions across spatial and
