               nonlinear ecological dynamics and complex human decision making
               are receiving more attention. SES modeling is maturing as a
               discipline in its own right, incorporating ideas from other
               interdisciplinary fields such as resilience or complex systems
               research. In this paper, we provide an overview of the emergence
