  author    = "Kang, Yun",
  journal   = "J. Differ. Equ. Appl.",
  publisher = "Informa UK Limited",
  volume    =  22,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "687--723",
  abstract  = "In this article, we propose and study a generalized
               Ricker–Beverton–Holt competition model subject to Allee effects
               to obtain insights on how the interplay of Allee effects and
               contest competition affects the persistence and the extinction of
               two competing species. By using the theory of monotone dynamics
