  volume    =  212,
  pages     = "15--23",
  abstract  = "Nutritional deprivation or desiccation can influence thermal
               tolerance by impacting the insects' ability to evaporatively
               cool, maintain cell membrane integrity and conduct protective or
               repair processes. Recovery from chilling is also linked to the
               re-establishment of iono- and osmo-regulatory homeostasis. Here,
