               ratio. We used A. chartifex colonies from a long-term
               fertilization experiment where phosphorus addition increased A.
               chartifex foraging activity with respect to controls. As foraging
               activity can be governed by resource availability, we first
               measured CTmax of field collected colonies. In freshly collected
               field colonies, CTmax was 2°C higher in control plots. This
