               community responses of herbivorous insects.",
  month     =  oct,
  year      =  2017,
  keywords  = "Azteca; CT(max); Neotropics; Stoichiometry; Sucrose; Thermal
               plasticity;TREE\_interactions",
  doi       = "10.1016/j.jinsphys.2017.08.007"
